5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"We need to fix the fee structure. Costs have shifted, and we must decide how to handle it fairly for everyone.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Before we pick a structure, we need to know what the next treasurer is actually signing up for.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I want to see how uneven the actual usage is before we debate the price.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I notice people hesitating to commit to evenings now. We need to understand why that hesitation is growing before we set the price.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I refuse to guess the numbers again. We need to know exactly what we can count on coming in before we set a single figure.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, @Jonathan, @Shunichi, @Takumi, please each pick two items from the list to investigate. We need data before we can decide.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Jonathan"",""Shunichi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Takumi, your point about reliable income is valid. I will check the bank statements and the treasurer's logged hours to see the real workload.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Asuka, I will check the sign-in sheets and the rota against attendance. I need to see who is actually doing the work versus who is just paying.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Asuka, I will check the weekday turnout since the summer outings and the winter social feedback. I need to see if the hesitation is tied to how we charge.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, I will check last year's ledger and the bank statements. I need to see the fixed costs and the actual cash flow to stop guessing.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, @Jonathan, @Shunichi, @Takumi, please confirm your two choices. We need to finalize the investigation list before moving to the next round.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Jonathan"",""Shunichi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,Confirmed. Bank statements and the outgoing treasurer's logged hours.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
