18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,Confirmed. Weekday turnout since the summer outings and quieter members at the winter social.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Takumi,,Confirmed. Last year's ledger of outgoings and bank statements on last year's renewals.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,All confirmed. We will review the findings next round.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Agreed. Let’s see what the numbers actually say before we start guessing.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,We’ll see who’s actually carrying the weight.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,We’ll see if the hesitation is just about the price or something deeper.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"No more guessing. I want the real numbers, not estimates.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
