38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,- **Shunichi**: The winter social feedback is telling. Three quiet members are anxious about the cost per visit.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"The ledger is brutal. Seventy percent of our costs are fixed, whether we have members or not.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Takumi"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Takumi: The ledger is brutal. Seventy percent of our costs are fixed, whether we have members or not.""}]}"
