44,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Benjamin, the ledger shows seventy percent of our costs are fixed, regardless of attendance.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,The taster forms are worrying. Nine of fourteen non-joiners refused to commit to a whole year at once.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Asuka"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Asuka: The taster forms are worrying. Nine of fourteen non-joiners refused to commit to a whole year at once.""}]}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Takumi, the ledger confirms the fixed costs. My hours log shows chasing individual payments takes six hours monthly, versus one for yearly.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,The sign-in sheets are damning. A quarter of members account for two-thirds of all attendances.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Jonathan"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Jonathan: The sign-in sheets are damning. A quarter of members account for two-thirds of all attendances.""}]}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Jonathan, that imbalance explains the hesitation. The quiet members at the winter social are terrified of paying for a year they barely use.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Benjamin, the bank statements show a third of renewals needed two reminders. We cannot rely on that for next year’s budget.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Asuka, those taster forms confirm my fear. If we force a full-year commitment, we lose the newcomers who need to drift in.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Takumi, that reminder data is exactly why I need the hours log. Chasing individual payments is a nightmare for the next treasurer.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shunichi, the rota confirms it. The same nine people who attend the most are the ones doing all the setup and locking up.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Jonathan, that confirms it. The core group carries the load, while the rest feel priced out. We need a structure that respects both.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Benjamin, that confirms it. We need a structure that doesn't rely on chasing people for money.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
